# Restaurant API – REST Client
#
# Endpoints: /restaurant
# Purpose:
# - Restaurant details and settings (1:1 with organization).
# - Each organization has exactly one restaurant.
# - No delete endpoint — removing the restaurant would break the organization.
#
# Auth / cookies:
# - If your API uses Better Auth cookie sessions, keep @cookieJar consistent across files.
# - Origin protection: include Origin + Referer headers on protected routes.
#
# Usage flow:
# 1) Run Auth login in auth.http (stores cookie in jar)
# 2) Run requests here (cookie is reused via the same jar name)
#
# Notes:
# - No {id} in paths — the restaurant is identified by organization context.
# - If your API is mounted under /api, set @apiPrefix = /api

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@cookieJar = betterauth

# If your server mounts routes under /api, set this to /api. Otherwise leave empty.
@apiPrefix = /api


### Get restaurant details - ok
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/restaurant
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/


### Create restaurant (only once per organization) - ok
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/restaurant
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "name": "The Golden Fork",
  "description": "Fine dining experience in the heart of downtown",
  "cuisineType": "Italian",
  "website": "https://goldenfork.com",
  "image": "https://example.com/image.jpg",
  "countryCode": "US",
  "vatNumber": "123456789",
  "taxOffice": "Tax Office",
  "profession": "Profession",
  "currency": "USD",

  "state": "NY",
  "city": "New York",
  "streetAddress": "123 Main Street",
  "zipCode": "10001",
  "longitude": "23.456789",
  "latitude": "23.456789",

  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-123-4567",
  "email": "info@goldenfork.com",
  "isActive": true

}


### Update restaurant (only include fields you want to change) - ok
PATCH {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/restaurant
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/

{
  "phoneNumber": "+1-555-NEW-PHONE",
  "website": "https://goldenfork-updated.com"
}
